"``'monitoring'``. See :class:`bdb.Bdb` for details. The user can set the "
"default backend to use if none is specified when instantiating "
":class:`Pdb`. If no backend is specified, the default is ``'settrace'``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../library/pdb.rst:249
